# Documents and the ICM workspace stay local. This repository ships code.
#
# Not a tidiness rule - it is the reason the history was rewritten on
# 2026-09-15, so these must never come back in by accident. A document you
# genuinely want published has to be added deliberately:
#
#     git add -f README.md
context/
*.md
